# 3AM
v1.2.1-stable

## New Features:
### Tap and Hold
Now you can tap and hold any music card to see and perform quick actions including Adding to favorites, Playlists or Playing a song next!

### Sleep Timer
A Bedtime icon right in the player action bar! Set a countdown (15m, 30m, 60m) or stop music automatically right when the current track finishes. Includes a smooth 10-second volume fade out so music doesn't abruptly stop.

### Auto Versioning
Made a Gradle build action. App diagnostics, build counters, and release notes now sync automatically on compile.

## Bug fixes
- Fixed a bug where contents from the previous screen would peak through the Insights header on the Insights Screen.
